  "worked_solution": "Using the formula for the vector projection, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{c}\\,d & =\\frac{c\\cdot d}{c\\cdot c}c \\\\  & =\\frac{{c}_{x}{d}_{x}+{c}_{y}{d}_{y}+{c}_{z}{d}_{z}}{{c}_{x}^{2}+{c}_{y}^{2}+{c}_{z}^{2}}c \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\cdot 2+1\\cdot (-3)+(-3)\\cdot 5}{{2}^{2}+{1}^{2}+(-3)^{2}}c \\\\  & =-\\frac{14}{14}\u27e82,1,-3\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8-2,-1,3\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
